     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I have mentioned the problem earlier, which I am facing in Distance software and it has not been resolved yet. </div><div>The software has been installed properly, also there is no problem in importing the data but it is showing a warning message during the analysis and the result are not been displayed. Kindly help me out with this. </div><div>I have also attached the picture of a warning message it is showing, please do have a look.</div><div>Apart from this, there is some problem regarding the &quot;install.log file&quot; whenever I am trying to uninstall the &quot;Distance&quot; application. please help me out with this as well. </div><div><div> Thank you</div><div><br></div><div>Regards<br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><b><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Nidhi Goyal</font></b></div>Project Associate <div>Wildlife Institute of India </div><div>Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ni...@wii.gov.in</a> </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div></div><br></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Fri, Jul 9, 2021 at 2:14 AM &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/distance-sampling/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(51,51,51)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/distance-sampling/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Sb62ZcJ1rE9p5fhcXqKyy\">\r\n              distance...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:rgb(221,75,57);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lfEtkvSscXtSO_T6WnIS8\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lfEtkvSscXtSO_T6WnIS8\"><img style=\"border:0px;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_6884586500983097510_m_7760659244296353437_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    Topic digest\r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/distance-sampling/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/distance-sampling/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Sb62ZcJ1rE9p5fhcXqKyy\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_6884586500983097510_m_7760659244296353437_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      mrds 2.2.5 and Distance 1.0.3 now on CRAN</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119)\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_6884586500983097510_m_7760659244296353437_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      problem in analysis</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119)\">2 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_6884586500983097510_m_7760659244296353437_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0px 5px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/distance-sampling/t/1bf44e17666ccc70?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/distance-sampling/t/1bf44e17666ccc70?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Nb4iQLJW6QJfyiPKJeOzo\">\r\n      mrds 2.2.5 and Distance 1.0.3 now on CRAN\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          David Lawrence Miller &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@ninepointeightone.net</a>&gt;: Jul 08 05:02PM +0100\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Hi listfolks,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nNew versions of mrds and Distance are now on CRAN. There are lots of<br>\r\nchanges in these new releases which we hope you&#39;ll find useful. There<br>\r\nwere so many changes I&#39;ve written a little blog post here:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n<a href=\"http://distancesampling.org/blog/2021/07/08/mrds-2.2.5-Distance-1.0.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://distancesampling.org/blog/2021/07/08/mrds-2.2.5-Distance-1.0.3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_qkAMBW-LWmARrTW7JNTi\">http://distancesampling.org/blog/2021/07/08/mrds-2.2.5-Distance-1.0.3</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nwhich summarises them all.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThanks again to all on the list who have reported bugs, asked for new<br>\r\nfeatures and have given feedback. We appreciate your time and this<br>\r\ngreatly improves the software for everyone.<br>\r\n <br>\r\ncheers,<br>\r\n--dave<br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_6884586500983097510_m_7760659244296353437_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_6884586500983097510_m_7760659244296353437_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0px 5px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/distance-sampling/t/193edabc841a0ade?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/distance-sampling/t/193edabc841a0ade?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qw3H1BdoZ-5pc4tc5jhzJ\">\r\n      problem in analysis\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          Nidhi Agarwal &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">agarwal...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jul 08 04:33AM -0700\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        ** Warning: Analysis engine wrote some output to the console error stream, <br>\r\nreproduced below. **<br>\r\nthe data has been analyzed in other system properly but can not run on my <br>\r\nsystem, results are not showing. <br>\r\nwhen i tried to uninstall it, it did not happen.<br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n      <tr><td style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          Eric R &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">erici...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jul 08 05:26AM -0700\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Agarwal<br>\r\n <br>\r\nIt is not completely clear what problems you are having with Distance for <br>\r\nWindows.  If you are not seeing results, you might need to make this change <br>\r\nto Distance for Windows:<br>\r\n <br>\r\nUse the &quot;Tools | Preferences&quot; menu choices to get to this screen:<br>\r\n[image: Screenshot 2021-07-08 132443.png]<br>\r\n <br>\r\nUntick the box for the line I have highlighted.  You might then need to run <br>\r\nthe analysis again, but hopefully it will then appear.<br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_6884586500983097510_m_7760659244296353437_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(99,99,99);font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/distance-sampling/join\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/distance-sampling/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472817805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mEb1_RuD_CmdCT5G9j0Ot\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">distance-sampl...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr></tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
