     1,
     "\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    <p><font face=\"Noto Sans\">Nidhi</font></p>\r\n    <p>Thanks for the additional information.  The remedy to this\r\n      problem is to install the Distance software in a different\r\n      directory, specifically in a Windows path that does not contain\r\n      spaces in the name.  Install Distance into a location other than\r\n      the default directory, for example when the installation programme\r\n      asks where to install the software, say &quot;C:/Distance&quot;<br>\r\n    </p></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div>\r\n    <div>On 09/07/2021 10:16, Nidhi Agarwal\r\n      wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    </div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>I have mentioned the problem earlier, which I am facing in\r\n          Distance software and it has not been resolved yet. </div>\r\n        <div>The software has been installed properly, also there is no\r\n          problem in importing the data but it is showing a warning\r\n          message during the analysis and the result are not been\r\n          displayed. Kindly help me out with this. </div>\r\n        <div>I have also attached the picture of a warning message it is\r\n          showing, please do have a look.</div>\r\n        <div>Apart from this, there is some problem regarding the\r\n          &quot;install.log file&quot; whenever I am trying to uninstall the\r\n          &quot;Distance&quot; application. please help me out with this as well. </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div> Thank you</div>\r\n          <div><br>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div>Regards<br clear=\"all\">\r\n            <div>\r\n              <div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">\r\n                <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n                  <div><b><font face=\"georgia, serif\">Nidhi Goyal</font></b></div>\r\n                  Project Associate \r\n                  <div>Wildlife Institute of India </div>\r\n                  <div>Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ni...@wii.gov.in</a> </div>\r\n                  <div><br>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n        <blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n          <div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n            <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:5px 20px\">\r\n              <table style=\"width:100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(99,99,99);font-size:11px\"><br>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                </tbody>\r\n              </table>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </blockquote>\r\n      </div></blockquote></div>"
